 minee Luke James as Elijah\, Bradley Jaden as Jesse\, and Solea Pfeiffer a
 nd Liisi LaFontaine as Mary and Martha Clarke.<br /><br /><em>Wanted</em> 
 features book and lyrics by <em>Variety</em> &ldquo\;Star to Watch&rdquo\;
  Angelica Ch&eacute\;ri\, a descendant of the Sisters Clarke\, and music b
 y Richard Rodgers Award&ndash\;winning composer Ross Baum. The production 
 is directed by Tony Award nominee and Obie Award&reg\; winner Stevie Walke
 r-Webb\, with choreography by Chelsey Arce.</p>
